much better experience when playing with a friend. And while there's an offline singleplayer mode, you don't make progression whatsoever (no achievements, no level ups, no rewards, etc.).\n\nJust play the newer version, Reactive Drop, for a better experience to this classic. Even if nobody plays on that version nowadays, you can still make progression on your own and that alone is worth playing over the original.", "timestamp_created": 1765293735, "timestamp_updated": 1782915909, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.60434269905090332", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 21, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "212732629", "author": {"steamid": "76561198217951953", "personaname": "wbyrne976", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jeffsharp/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 288, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 264, "last_played": 1765073283, "avatar": "201d94e64376a4741e53c74b64a944ee6b490d35"}, "language": "english", "review": "very funnn", "timestamp_created": 1765063582, "timestamp_updated": 1765063582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525969624519348145", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212705899", "author": {"steamid": "76561199164993329", "personaname": "▶FENIX◀", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199164993329/", "num_games_owned": 467, "num_reviews": 391, "playtime_forever": 879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 879, "last_played": 1777993935, "avatar": "768fdf4360f13bbe6d5715921a7176fbf34ca711"}, "language": "english", "review": "Что про это можно сказать...\nНу это не очень продукт, смахивате на то что разработчики решили подсасаться к чужим и их вселенной \nОнлаина - нет\nУправление - не очень \nБаги - присутствуют \nОбновления - нет\nЗабытая ли это игра?\nОпределённа: ДА\nКампания добавлена: просто для галочки.\nПро эту игру даже никто не помнит и не знает.\nНа любителя \n\n\nWhat can I say about this... \nWell, it's not a very good product; it looks like the developers decided to gravitate toward aliens and their universe. \nOnline - no \nControls - not very good \nBugs - present \nUpdates - none\nIs this a forgotten game? \nDefinitely: YES \nCampaign added: just for show. \nNo one even remembers or knows about this game. \nA bit of an acquired taste.\n", "timestamp_created": 1765039684, "timestamp_updated": 1788802369, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.441605865955352783", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212563159", "author": {"steamid": "76561199485248081", "personaname": "ScritcherTM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199485248081/", "num_games_owned": 98, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 6, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6, "last_played": 1764774637, "avatar": "894f8cc121a811e6c4a0bd4e96926ca8abeed6f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "gut", "timestamp_created": 1764873748, "timestamp_updated": 1764873748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502380967140197754", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_rele